 each other’s strengths and scars by the trail of illicit fingertips down their skin.<br /><br />They are never supposed to defy the rules and become each other’s whole world.<br /><br />But they do. <br /><br />Except peril and betrayal lurk closer than they ever imagined and everything they care about—including their lives—is in danger of unraveling. <br /><br />Because sometimes first love is filthy, wild, and messy. <br /><br />But it can also be the beginning of something extraordinary. <br /><br />Filthy Beginnings: A Dark Fated-Mates Romance Prequel is the prequel to Filthy Royal: A Dark Fated-Mates Romance, Book 4 in the Ruthless Warlords series. <br /><br />It contains high-heat romance, action, and ends on a cliffhanger. The completion of Damien and Scarlett’s epic romance will occur in Filthy Royal. It is recommended you read the Ruthless Warlord books in order to obtain the greatest enjoyment.</span></div></div></div><div class=""></div></div></div><div data-testid="genresList" class="BookPageMetadataSection__genres"><ul class="CollapsableList" aria-label="Top genres for this book"><span tabindex="-1"><span class="BookPageMetadataSection__genrePlainText"><span class="Text Text__body3 Text__subdued">Genres</span></span><span class="BookPageMetadataSection__genreButton"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/genres/omegaverse" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">Omegaverse</span></a></span><span class="BookPageMetadataSection__genreButton"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/genres/science-fiction" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">Science Fiction</span></a></span><span class="BookPageMetadataSection__genreButton"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/genres/romance" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">Romance</span></a></span><span class="BookPageMetadataSection__genreButton"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/genres/dark-romance" class="Button Butt