oved the characters. Damien is a young alpha searching for his place in his family. Scarlett has accepted that she isn’t more than a possession. But meeting each other, falling for each other, and becoming enemies in the end, is what puts them on their path to becoming who they really are. But that’s a story for the next book.<br /><br />The narrators are back and are amazing, as usual.<br /><br />Quickie<br /><br />- Series: Ruthless warlords #4A (prequel to the next book)<br />- Hashtags: #SF romance #omegaverse #aliens #fated mates #virgin<br />- Triggers: lots of violence, abuse and death, mention of past extreme child abuse<br />- Main couple: Scarlett &amp; Damien Skolov<br />- Hotness: 5/5<br />- Romance: 4/5<br />- + young cocky hero with a lot of heart, yes!<br />- – fated mates means no need for seduction</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">5 likes</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.170820