he prelude to Alison's upcoming book, FILTHY ROYAL. The prelude and the upcoming book give us the hot and steamy romantic story of Damien Skolov and Scarlett. FILTHY BEGINNINGS takes us back to the time when the Skolovs were not rich and had fought their way into the underworld to survive. Damien is the younger, screw-up brother who wants desperately to help his family. In his youth and i experience , he sets out to do this by winning a seat on the council, never knowing he is doomed to fail in this before he even begins. He meets Scarlett, a prize to be awarded to the victor. Oh, there are red, hot flames! For those of us following the series, this book is a must-read. If you are new to the Skolov family, then read this and, by all means, go back to the first books to catch up while waiting for FILTHY ROYAL. AWESOME series!</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">1 like</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 