 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5592914578">June 3, 2023</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Filthy indeed ☺️🔥<br /><br />Well, if this doesn’t get you all riled up in anticipation of Damion Skolov's story, I don’t know what will!! <br /><br />Any fan of the Ruthless Warlords series needs to read this prequel!! <br /><br />Filthy Beginnings takes place prior to events in the other books in this series. It’s about a young Damien Skolov trying to help his family and prove to his brothers that he is a strong, capable, formidable grown Alpha by entering a fighting tournament. The prizes for winning are not only monetary but a beautiful Omega. Scarlett the consortium-owned omega and prize attraction for the tournament had grown up knowing her fate and though she longed for freedom she never put much stock into hoping for it, until Damien Skolov enters the arena and the first itch of the fared mates bond began to burn under her skin…<br /><br />Just writing that has made me want to go read it again ASAP! As a fan of this series, this book certainly gave some insight on Damien and answers a lot of questions about the cause of his temperament. It also leaves you with so many more questions I’m so anxious for the answers to. It’s just freaking brilliant and maddening at the same time! Now I maintain that I’ve loved every single Skolov brother in this series, with Alexi being my top favorite. but I have been so pumped up about Damien, and if the prequel is any indication, Alexi just might have some competition for the top spot! I LOVED it!! Would definitely recommend snagging this read before reading Filthy Royal the 4th book in the Ruthless Warlords series</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">1 like</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15.4980616 L19,15.8397024 L19,16.1036344 C19,16.7361314 18.6701344,17.3185188 18.1373501,17.6453922 L17.9472136,17.7480616 C17.4795438,17.9818965 16.9638538,18.1036344 16.440983,18.1036344 L9.66834148,18.1034086 C9.31027068,18.6437214 8.696742,19 8,19 L6,19 C4.8954305,19 4,18.1045695 4,17 L4,12 C4,10.8954305 4.8954305,10 6,10 L8,10 C8.60249245,10 9.14276174,10.2664091 9.50943372,10.6878531 L9.58578644,10.6036344 L11,9.18942086 L11,6.75238209 C10.9999468,5.91477784 11.5910613,5.19356674 12.4123594,5.02913493 C13.3640475,4.8385978 14.290004,5.45563256 14.4813282,6.41129383 Z M8,11 L6,11 C5.44771525,11 5,11.4477153 5,12 L5,17 C5,17.5522847 5.44771525,18 6,18 L8,18 C8.55228475,18 9,17.552284