.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5401898542">June 10, 2023</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Filthy Beginnings, the prequel to Filthy Royal, which highlights the fast paced and, somewhat unusual, courtship that transpires between Damien and Scarlett.<br /><br />Scarlett is Consortium property and is set as part of the winnings, a prize to be won, in the tournament of cage fighters entering a galactic fighting tournament. She's a beautiful dancer that shimmers colors and is kept in a glass cage. Her entire life has been under Consortium rule and her only hope is to be won by a fair and just fighter, which she knows is unlikely, or to escape. With odds stacked against her, she would still rather try to run than give up her life to a brute. That is until she meets Damien.<br /><br />Enter Damien Skolov, a young fighter with nothing to his name and proving his worth through using his fists. Damien originally only entered the tournament to win the cash prize, but the moment he sees Scarlett he's sucked into her orbit and the mating heat hits both of them hard and fast. While he still wants the money, he also wants to win Scarlett and her freedom. He's young and impetuous, but he's also gentle and sweet when it comes to Scarlett. Yes, he also shows her how dirty he can be without jeopardizing her actual purity, and let me tell you, these two burn for one another.<br /><br />Their quick time at the tournament blazes hot and fast and there is a lot that transpires due to the quickness of their time together, there is also a lot that happens that also tears them apart just as quickly. This beginning part of the story shapes their future and jump starts their destiny to how they meet again, but under very different circumstances. It's heartbreaking, but I LOVED how Alison set up this part of the story to continue on with the rest which will continue in Filthy Royal.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10209236?shelf=dark-romance" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">dark-romance</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10209236?shelf=fantasy-sci-fi-pnr-supernatural" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">fantasy-sci-fi-pnr-supernatural</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10209236?shelf=fated-mates" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">fated-mates</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">1 like</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.6