3.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5894366140">October 9, 2023</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Filthy Beginnings, Ruthless Warlords #4A) by Alison Aimes<br />Narration by Jason Clarke and Stella Hunter. <br /><br />That prequel was just what I needed to hear while making a long drive to dinner at my friends home. It was a solo trip and I blasted it both ways. <br /><br />This is the prequel to Damien Skolov’s story and it had my heart stopping at times and also had me virtually panting during all the sex scenes. <br /><br />This series has hot alpha males beating on one another which were the spots that had my heart racing. Damien is out to prove himself to his family and the rink where other alphas battle it out is where he seeks his recognition. <br /><br />He spots the omega Scarlett who is the prize and knows he has to have her. Their chemistry is off the charts yet they know it’s a battle to win the tournament and her but he’s going to prove he has it in him. <br /><br />There’s so much here in this prequel that it seems to be the whole story but it’s just the start and I can’t wait to find out where they end up. <br /><br />The parts where they sneak into getting together is what had me so worried that they would be found out. Where my heart stopped beating of worry for what might happen if they were discovered. Then had me squirming in my seat for all the hotness of these two main characters making out. 🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥 put me out because I am on fire!<br /><br />Then the ending had me tearing up and anxious to know what happened to both Damien and Scarlett because they certainly didn’t get their HEA yet!<br /><br />I listened to this book in audio and these Omega universe books are full of tension and mystery. The audio brings the characters to full glory and I loved how they came to life with these actors portrayals of them. Soooo much better in audio. ♥️</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15.4980616 L19,15.8397024 L19,16.1036344 C19,16.7361314 18.6701344,17.3185188 18.1373501,17.6453922 L17.9472136,17.7480616 C17.4795438,17.9818965 16.9638538,18.1036344 16.440983,18.1036344 L9.66834148,18.1034086 C9.31027068,18.6437214 8.696742,19 8,19 L6,19 C4.8954305,19 4,18.1045695 4,17 L4,12 C4,10.8954305 4.8954305,10 6,10 L8,10 C8.60249245,10 9.14276174,10.2664091 9.50943372,10.6878531 L9.58578644,10.6036344 L11,9.18942086 L11,6.75238209 C10.9999468,5.91477784 11.5910613,5.19356674 12.4123594,5.02913493 C13.3640475,4.8385978 14.290004,5.45563256 14.4813282,6.41129383 Z 