teries that the book works really well as a prequel: it creates expectations.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI loved the characters. Damien is a young alpha searching for his place in his family. Scarlett has accepted that she isn’t more than a possession. But meeting each other, falling for each other, and becoming enemies in the end, is what puts them on their path to becoming who they really are. But that’s a story for the next book.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe narrators are back and are amazing, as usual.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eQuickie\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e- Series: Ruthless warlords #4A (prequel to the next book)\u003cbr /\u003e- Hashtags: #SF romance #omegaverse #aliens #fated mates #virgin\u003cbr /\u003e- Triggers: lots of violence, abuse and death, mention of past extreme child abuse\u003cbr /\u003e- Main couple: Scarlett \u0026amp; Damien Skolov\u003cbr /\u003e- Hotness: 5/5\u003cbr /\u003e- Romance: 4/5\u003cbr /\u003e- + young cocky hero with a lot of heart, yes!\u003cbr /\u003e- – fated mates means no need for seduction","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A39A6VVMKWFPTV\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.yqLxzXANQRqbsywx\"}}"},"likeCount":5,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:66201886":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":66201886,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":4,"textReviewsCount":1344,"name":"Marlene Davis","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/66201886-marlene-davis","contributor":null,"id":66201886},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1TMYBID45YVAY":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1TMYBID45YVAY"},"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.EV4f8VwtPILycUho":{"__typename":"Book","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.EV4f8VwtPILycUho"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1TMYBID45YVAY\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.EV4f8VwtP