ade me stop breathing and pray for a happy ending. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDamien and Scarlett have such incredible chemistry you can feel their emotions jumping off the pages. They belong together in every sense of the word. But when outside forces threaten both of them, can they fight and persevere? Once I finished, I needed more! More Damien! More Scarlett! Now I’m dying for more of their story!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3ELW1RUOLM8B0\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.EV4f8VwtPILycUho\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":1},"User:77019909":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":77019909,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1602985103i/77019909._UX200_CR0,26,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":13,"textReviewsCount":1031,"name":"Jean Stillman","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/77019909-jean-stillman","contributor":null,"id":77019909},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2Y9IQGZ3D928M":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Y9IQGZ3D928M"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Y9IQGZ3D928M\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.EV4f8VwtPILycUho\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2Y9IQGZ3D928M","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Y9IQGZ3D928M"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.EV4f8VwtPILycUho","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.EV4f8VwtPILycUho"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/77019909?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5022243036"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.NHdJ55VPANIWYmVFS_JkfQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.NHdJ55VPANIWYmVFS_JkfQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:77019909"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1683994402681,"createdAt":1664740613574,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1683994402519,"text":"OMG! FILTHY BEGINNINGS, by Alison Aimes, is the prelude to Alison's upcoming book, FILTHY ROYAL. The prelude and the upcoming book give us the hot and steamy romantic story of Damien Skolov and Scarlett. FILTHY BEGINNINGS takes us back to the time when the Skolovs were not rich and had fought their way into the underworld to survive. Damien is the younger, screw-up brother who wants desperately to help his family. In his youth and i experience , he sets out to do this by winning a seat on the council, never knowing he is doomed to fail in this before he even begins. He meets Scarlett, a prize to be awarded to the victor. Oh, there are red, hot flames! For those of us following the series, this book is a must-read. If you are new to the Skolov family, then read this and, by all means, go back to the first books to catch up while waiting for FILTHY ROYAL. AWESOME series!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Y9IQGZ3D928M\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.EV4f8VwtPILycUho\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:129268839":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":129268839,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1666491600i/129268839._UY200_CR30,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":4,"textReviewsCount":226,"name":"Holly Grays","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/129268839-holly-grays","contributor":null,"id":129268839},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A33IQQBZ9MXRUY":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A33IQQBZ9MXRUY"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A33IQQBZ9MXRUY\"},\"book\":{\"id\":