odreads.v1.gYgf4ptFPjJrOaCLtML29g","creator":{"__ref":"User:42497829"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1697388775483,"createdAt":1685795800911,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1685796049113,"text":"Filthy indeed ☺️🔥\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWell, if this doesn’t get you all riled up in anticipation of Damion Skolov's story, I don’t know what will!! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAny fan of the Ruthless Warlords series needs to read this prequel!! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFilthy Beginnings takes place prior to events in the other books in this series. It’s about a young Damien Skolov trying to help his family and prove to his brothers that he is a strong, capable, formidable grown Alpha by entering a fighting tournament. The prizes for winning are not only monetary but a beautiful Omega. Scarlett the consortium-owned omega and prize attraction for the tournament had grown up knowing her fate and though she longed for freedom she never put much stock into hoping for it, until Damien Skolov enters the arena and the first itch of the fared mates bond began to burn under her skin…\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJust writing that has made me want to go read it again ASAP! As a fan of this series, this book certainly gave some insight on Damien and answers a lot of questions about the cause of his temperament. It also leaves you with so many more questions I’m so anxious for the answers to. It’s just freaking brilliant and maddening at the same time! Now I maintain that I’ve loved every single Skolov brother in this series, with Alexi being my top favorite. but I have been so pumped up about Damien, and if the prequel is any indication, Alexi just might have some competition for the top spot! I LOVED it!! Would definitely recommend snagging this read before reading Filthy Royal the 4th book in the Ruthless Warlords series","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A25ZSLKVTF40CS\"