d me squirming in my seat for all the hotness of these two main characters making out. 🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥 put me out because I am on fire!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThen the ending had me tearing up and anxious to know what happened to both Damien and Scarlett because they certainly didn’t get their HEA yet!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI listened to this book in audio and these Omega universe books are full of tension and mystery. The audio brings the characters to full glory and I loved how they came to life with these actors portrayals of them. Soooo much better in audio. ♥️","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AYTWA30GANE2U\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.yqLxzXANQRqbsywx\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:84623690":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":84623690,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":3435,"name":"Sue","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/84623690-sue","contributor":null,"id":84623690},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AOXRNQCLC69GE":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AOXRNQCLC69GE"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AOXRNQCLC69GE\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.EV4f8VwtPILycUho\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AOXRNQCLC69GE","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AOXRNQCLC69GE"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.EV4f8VwtPILycUho","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.EV4f8VwtPILycUho"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/84623690?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5546548415"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2023051220.d7e4a4c8-b9b7-4349-ae0