as talking. Jason also does the villain voices so so well. Stella can bring the emotions into a story perfectly and I am always in awe of her.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDamien and Scarlett are definitely a forbidden love story. As she is being pushed into the direction of someone else but her heart belongs completely to Damien. Damien knows that he isn't the right man for her but the heart wants what the heart wants...and his is craving Scarlett. The pull that these two had for each other from the very beginning was palpable...you could feel it. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWith the way this one ended, I am immediately diving into Filthy Royal. I need to know how these two are going to find their way.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LZO7LN8X6J9X\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.yqLxzXANQRqbsywx\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:10601284":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":10601284,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1709175148i/10601284._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":1237,"name":"Theresa","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/10601284-theresa","contributor":null,"id":10601284},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1ST7GPWRJN9P7":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1ST7GPWRJN9P7"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1ST7GPWRJN9P7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.yqLxzXANQRqbsywx\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1ST7GPWRJN9P7","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1ST7GPWRJN9P7"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.yqLxzXANQRqbsywx","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.yqLxzXANQRqbsywx"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionTy